        "-ms-content-zoom-chaining\u{1}Specifies the zoom behavior that occurs when a user hits the zoom limit during a manipulation.\u{1}chained none\u{1}none | chained\u{1}x",
        "-ms-content-zooming\u{1}Specifies whether zooming is enabled.\u{1}none zoom\u{1}none | zoom\u{1}x",
        "-ms-content-zoom-limit\u{1}Shorthand property for the -ms-content-zoom-limit-min and -ms-content-zoom-limit-max properties.\u{1}\u{1}<'-ms-content-zoom-limit-min'> <'-ms-content-zoom-limit-max'>\u{1}x",
