        "animation-range-start\u{1}The animation-range-start CSS property is used to set the start of an animation's attachment range along its timeline, i.e. where along the timeline an animation will start.\u{1}\u{1}[ normal | <length-percentage> | <timeline-range-name> <length-percentage>? ]#\u{1}",
