        "scroll-timeline\u{1}Defines a name that can be used to identify the source element of a scroll timeline, along with the scrollbar axis that should provide the timeline.\u{1}\u{1}[ <'scroll-timeline-name'> <'scroll-timeline-axis'>? ]#\u{1}",
