        "output\u{1}The output element represents the result of a calculation performed by the application, or the result of a user action.\u{1}for\u{3}A space-separated list of other elements\u{2019} ids, indicating that those elements contributed input values to (or otherwise affected) the calculation.\u{3}\u{2}form\u{3}The form element that this element is associated with (its \"form owner\"). The value of the attribute must be an id of a form element in the same document.\u{3}\u{2}name\u{3}The name of the element, exposed in the HTMLFormElement API.\u{3}",
